                "line": 242,
                "quote": "MaxRenewals = Loans.renewLimitOf loan library"
              },
              {
                "file": "src/Lending.Transition/Loans.fs",
                "line": 66,
                "quote": "| None -> Policy.renewLimit Standard"
              }
            ],
            "rationale": "One definition, `Policy.renewLimit`, is reached through `Loans.renewLimitOf` from both `renewalRefusal` and the `renew` view. The old single constant is replaced, not kept beside the new one. The decision doc is updated to revision 2. The fallback to Standard when the member is missing is a defensive default, not a second statement of a limit. `renewalRefusal` calls `renewLimitOf` twice, which is harmless because it is the same pure function.",
            "score": 2
